#X obj 60 3992 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Envelope 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 4020 sus and end act on the selected envelope (env) of the selected line., f 64;
#X obj 460 4080 s \$0-cz4;
