#X text 82 6156 bend (0): pitch wheel \, -1 to 1. The range in semitones is the control bendrange. \; mod (0): modulation wheel \, 0 to 1. Adds vibrato \, as deep as wheel says. \; at (0): aftertouch \, 0 to 1: vibrato (atvib) and level (atamp). \; sustain (0): hold pedal. Notes released while it is 1 sound until it returns to 0., f 64;
#X obj 60 6282 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Selection 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
